      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive been having this really bad gnawing pain in my upper stomach for like a month now... feels like constant indigestion or maybe even an ulcer. im taking omeprazole every morning for it which helps a bit, but not much. \n\nanyway i just got a massive toothache on my bottom side and it's driving me crazy. is it okay if i just take some ibuprofen for the tooth? i dont want to make my stomach worse but i cant focus on work with this pain. would the omeprazole protect my stomach enough if i take the advil?",
